WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:06.971
"How was school today, kids?" Mom asked.

2
00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:10.923
"Terrible!" Oliver said.

3
00:00:10.924 --> 00:00:17.654
"Mrs. Crosby is gone." Harry sighed.

4
00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:21.916
"She was our favorite lunch lady."

5
00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:24.413
Emmy looked sad.

6
00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:28.062
"We didn't even get to say good-bye."

7
00:00:28.063 --> 00:00:33.038
"Let's make Mrs. Crosby a card," Mom said.

8
00:00:33.039 --> 00:00:37.366
"Someone at school will know where to send it."

9
00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:41.717
Harry and Oliver got paper and crayons.

10
00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:45.393
Emmy found glitter and glue.

11
00:00:45.394 --> 00:00:49.527
Everyone sat at the kitchen table.

12
00:00:49.528 --> 00:00:55.192
"Mrs. Crosby gave us treats on special days," Harry said.

13
00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:58.491
"Like the first day of school."

14
00:00:58.492 --> 00:01:05.508
He drew cupcakes on the card.

15
00:01:05.509 --> 00:01:09.481
"She liked jokes," Oliver said.

16
00:01:09.482 --> 00:01:13.450
He drew Mrs. Crosby laughing.

17
00:01:13.451 --> 00:01:18.006
"She sang while she worked," Emmy said.

18
00:01:18.007 --> 00:01:23.132
She drew Mrs. Crosby singing and serving soup.

19
00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:27.361
The next morning the kids waited for the school bus.

20
00:01:27.362 --> 00:01:30.850
Oliver stared as it came closer.

21
00:01:30.851 --> 00:01:35.416
"That driver looks like Mrs. Crosby!"

22
00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:42.582
"No way! You're seeing things," Harry said.

23
00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:47.676
"It is Mrs. Crosby!" Emmy said.

24
00:01:47.677 --> 00:01:51.328
Oliver jumped up and down with excitement.

25
00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:55.547
They all rushed on board.

26
00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:59.294
Mrs. Crosby held out a basket.

27
00:01:59.295 --> 00:02:03.621
"Treats to celebrate my new job!"

28
00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:08.902
Harry took a cupcake and grinned.

29
00:02:08.903 --> 00:02:17.200
Oliver told a joke.

30
00:02:17.201 --> 00:02:20.914
Mrs. Crosby laughed.

31
00:02:20.915 --> 00:02:28.582
Emmy handed her their card.

32
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:32.756
"Hey, kids!" Mrs. Crosby said.

33
00:02:32.757 --> 00:02:43.156
"Is everybody ready to sing?"

